4
00:00:13.439 --> 00:00:17.849
Today we learn about Basic Database Concepts. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:24.003
Database. Say it with me. Database!

6
00:00:27.464 --> 00:00:31.120
Table. Say it with me. Table!

7
00:00:34.657 --> 00:00:38.323
Record. Say it with me. Record!

8
