Field. Say it with me. Field!

9
00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:52.967
Store data. Say it with me. Store data!

10
00:00:56.446 --> 00:01:01.007
Organize. Say it with me. Organize!

11
00:01:04.545 --> 00:01:08.478
Query. Say it with me. Query!

12
00:01:11.976 --> 00:01:16.126
