13
00:01:19.624 --> 00:01:30.175
A database stores structured data in a table. Each record is a row, and a field is a column. I can query a database to organize and find data.

14
00:01:30.225 --> 00:01:34.030
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:35.032 --> 00:01:40.495
