16
00:01:40.545 --> 00:01:41.695
Record!

17
00:01:42.592 --> 00:01:48.020
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:49.220
Query!

19
00:01:50.345 --> 00:01:58.840
Did you know? Databases can store and organize billions of pieces of information, far more than any spreadsheet could handle!

20
00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.198
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.171 --> 00:02:11.911
Think and answer. What kind of information might be stored in a school database?

22
00:02:11.961 --> 00:02:13.122
Great answer!

23
00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:19.857
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
